#
# BuildKit picks this up automatically for `-f deploy/docker/ne-app/Dockerfile`
# (the <Dockerfile>.dockerignore convention). It trims the repo-root build
# context to just what the three stages need (pyproject/uv.lock + packages/ +
# tools/ + ne-console sources), keeping *.md INCLUDED (package pyprojects may
# declare a readme).
.git
.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
deploy
docs
demo
.github
**/tests
